e.net/oaklands/images/c/c4/Ice_Stone3.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240302170646\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c4/Ice_Stone3.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240302170646 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c4/Ice_Stone3.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20240302170646 2x\" data-relevant=\"1\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Forged\" width=\"270\" height=\"211\" data-image-key=\"Ice Stone3.png\" data-image-name=\"Ice Stone3.png\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay, Snowlands, Ice Cave</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Stone\">Stone</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">Refined</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">Forged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Stone\">$16/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">$32/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">$48/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.45.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">December 10th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ingame</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<b>Blue Ice</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Ores\" title=\"Category:Ores\">ore</a> that was added in <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log/Version_1.45.0\" title=\"Update Log/Version 1.45.0\">v1.45.0</a>. It is exclusively found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Snowlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowlands\">Snowlands</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Blue Ice can only be found in a cave in the Snowlands. This cave has a frozen river passing through it. Its color is a light, cyan-ish blue. Icestone, in all of its forms, has greatly reduced friction. This can be used to build schematics on one's property with a slippery surface.\n</p><p>Unlike many other stone types, Blue Stone has no ores that spawn inside of it.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>During pre-release, Blue Stone would spawn with nuggets of snow inside, that when forged, would yield the same material as <a href=\"/wiki/Snow_tree\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snow tree\">Snowtree</a>. Refining it would result in a lighter shade of ice.</li>\n<li>Blue Ice was one of the first rock types ever added to the game, initially made for the QA testing team to celebrate Christmas 2022 and build snow themed bases.</li>\n<li>Two Blue Ice filled schematics could be briefly seen in the first trailer<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> of Oaklands. The material would release to the public only during the 2023 Christmas update with the addition of <a href=\"/wiki/Snowlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowlands\">Snowlands</a>.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UzDP_6s95GQ&amp;t=115s&amp;pp=ygUQb2FrbGFuZHMgdHJhaWxlcg%3D%3D\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UzDP_6s95GQ&amp;t=115s&amp;pp=ygUQb2FrbGFuZHMgdHJhaWxlcg%3D%3D</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903133203\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nC